ObservationalSUCC.GlobalSigned.finite_forcing_defect_transport : ∀ (u w : ℕ → ℝ) (T : ℕ),
  (∀ i ≤ T, 0 ≤ u i) →
    (∀ i < T, 0 ≤ w i) →
      (∀ i < T, w i ≤ u (i + 1) + 16 * u i) → ∑ i ∈ Finset.range T, w i ^ 2 ≤ 289 * ∑ i ∈ Finset.range (T + 1), u i ^ 2
'ObservationalSUCC.GlobalSigned.finite_forcing_defect_transport' depends on axioms: [propext,
 Classical.choice,
 Quot.sound]
